<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cumnock half year profit down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cumnock half year profit down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.57 vs   1.56</p>
<p>    Net					0.51 vs   1.28</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	    nil vs    nil</p>
<p>    Sales				   52.37 vs  38.84</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.08 vs   0.24</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    1.6  vs   5.4</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 0.36 vs   0.52</p>
